<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 12.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.69     5.10</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     13.68     1.90</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	12.13     1.01</p>
<p> 4   MT Leyshon Gold	10.96     2.28</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	   9.58     0.95</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.41     1.08</p>
<p> 7   Villa World	     9.40     1.17</p>
<p> 8   Aust Tour		 9.38     0.80</p>
<p> 9   BT Prop Trust	   9.33     1.75</p>
<p>10   Centro Prop	     8.86     2.20</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.57     0.91</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 8.41     1.23</p>
<p>13   Spotless Svc	    8.33     1.32</p>
<p>14   Colonial Coml	   8.20     2.25</p>
<p>15   Equitilink		8.06     0.62</p>
